### One important strategic decision

I'd **move Learn360 out of the opening sentence**.

Learn360 should become one of your **featured projects**, where it can actually receive enough space to demonstrate what you've built.

Likewise, Ntcheu Development Centre should get its own professional/experience entry rather than being squeezed into About.

This gives the portfolio a cleaner hierarchy:

